{
 "title": "IBIS-AMI near-package optics: TW-MZM PAM4 link",
 "group": "Photonic links",
 "description": "53.125 GBd PAM4 NPO: IBIS-AMI Tx (FFE) -> 15 dB host trace -> CTLE driver -> traveling-wave Si MZM -> 500 m -> PD/TIA -> 15 dB trace -> IBIS-AMI Rx; flow: CTLE, Tx FFE and MZM bias for max OMA_outer - TDECQ",
 "schematic": {
  "notes": [
   {
    "x": 20,
    "y": -360,
    "title": "Near-package optics, 53.125 GBd PAM4: IBIS-AMI SerDes, 15 dB host traces, CTLE driver, traveling-wave Si MZM",
    "lines": [
     "TX1 (IBIS-AMI pf_tx, FFE) launches 2 Vppd EMF into CHT: package, BGA, vias, a PCB",
     "trace with 15 dB loss at 26.56 GHz, LGA and module substrate, terminated in the",
     "driver's 100 ohm input (reflections included).",
     "DRV: CTLE, gain, tanh output stage; 40 ohm back-terminations, pads and flip-chip",
     "bumps feed two 3.5 mm traveling-wave PN arms (push-pull, loaded line ~40 ohm)",
     "terminated on chip into the 2 V junction bias (VT). WG_B's length sets the MZM's",
     "optical bias phase (90 deg = quadrature). TP2 = ptx, in fiber.",
     "500 m SMF, PD, 500 ohm TIA, CHR (the same 15 dB trace back, P/N crossed) and RX1",
     "(pf_rx: CTLE, 11-tap FFE, DFE, Mueller-Muller CDR, 5 nV/rtHz input noise).",
     "",
     "Flow (Run panel -> Flow): Bayesian search over the driver CTLE peaking and gain,",
     "pf_tx c(-1) / c(+1) / c(+2) and the MZM bias phase for the largest OMA_outer - TDECQ",
     "on a 2k-UI eye, then a final 8k-UI run reporting TDECQ, OMA_outer, RLM, ER and the",
     "IBIS-AMI Rx BER (statistical and counted).",
     "CHT / CHR are exact terminated channels, vector-fitted with the flight delay",
     "removed (fit error ~0.1 %, echoes included)."
    ]
   }
  ],
